{
  "default": null,
  "variants": {
    "standard-dialogue-on-main-game-worlds": [
      {
        "npc": "Hello, I've got some wares in you might have lost. Care to take a look?"
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "prompt": "What would you like to say?",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "Who are you and what do you sell?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Who are you and what do you sell?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "I'm Chris, travelling repairman. If you need something repaired, I can do it for you if you've got the money for it."
              },
              {
                "npc": "I've also got a collection of items people end up losing a lot. Nothing fancy, and certainly nothing you couldn't get elsewhere, maybe for free. Still, I charge a convenience fee for having it right here. Interested?"
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "text": "Show me what you've got.",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "below",
                        "id": "6JQT_J"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "No thanks.",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "below",
                        "id": "2V0Ld4"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Show me what you've got.",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Show me what you've got."
              },
              {
                "type": "action",
                "action": "open_shop",
                "target": "Lost Property shop",
                "id": "B70SU2"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "About items that break when people kill me...",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "About items that break when people kill me..."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Yeah, some things will break if you get killed in the Wilderness. And if you die deep in the Wilderness, they can vanish altogether."
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "text": "Can you fix them?",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "Can you fix them?"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "For a fee, sure. Just show me the broken item."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Can you stop them vanishing in deep Wilderness?",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "Can you stop them vanishing in deep Wilderness?"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Well, if you bring me a Trouver Parchment and some coins, I can enchant some items so they won't disappear if you end up losing them deep in the Wilderness."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "If you need a Trouver Parchment, there's a mage up in Ferox Enclave called Justine who sells them. I've also heard rumours there's a cave in the Wilderness with creatures that sometimes carry them as well."
                      },
                      {
                        "player": "Why would wild creatures be carrying magic parchments?"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Eh, some poor sap walks in carrying one, gets himself killed, and the creature just hangs on to it as a trophy? I can see it."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "No thanks.",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "No thanks."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "standard-dialogue-on-pvp-arena-worlds": [
      {
        "npc": "Hey there. I can't offer my usual services right now, but if you're interested, I picked up a few bits that would let me change your appearance, if you're interested."
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "Can I get a body makeover?",
